---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
const title = "个人介绍页面";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <div class="mywords">
    <h2>{title}</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
          <a
            href="#"
            target="_blank"
            data-bs-toggle="modal"
            data-bs-target="#exampleModal"
            ><img
              src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85427807"
              class="card-img"
              style="scale: 60%"
              alt="GitHub 头像"
            /></a
          >
          <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="text-center">Mcenahle</h4>
            <hr />
            <table class="table table-borderless">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row">目标学校</th>
                  <td>上海师范大学</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row">ORCID</th>
                  <td
                    ><a
                      href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8499-4500"
                      target="_blank"
                    >
                      <u>0009-0009-8499-4500</u>&nbsp;
                      <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
                    ></td
                  >
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row">电子邮件</th>
                  <td>hi@mcenahle.page</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <!-- <p class="card-text">
              <b>目标学校</b>
              <span style="margin-left: 6px;">上海师范大学</span>
            </p>
            <p class="card-text">
              <b>ORCID</b>
              <span style="margin-left: 16px;"
                ><a
                  href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8499-4500"
                  target="_blank"
                >
                  <u>0009-0009-8499-4500</u>&nbsp;
                  <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
                ></span
              >
            </p>
            <p class="card-text">
              <b>电子邮件</b>
              <span style="margin-left: 6px;">hi@mcenahle.page</span>
            </p> -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">个人介绍</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>
              我的兴趣爱好算是比较广的，但主要还是计算机代码（网络前端方向），当然，为了成为一名教师，现在也对教育学很感兴趣。
            </p>
            <p>
              闲来无事，也会经常上
              pmc。这应该是硕士医学生天天上的，但我也会上着玩，看看这些医学论文。这个网站我也最终背了出来：<a
                href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov"
                target="_blank"
                ><u>pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov</u>&nbsp;
                <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
              >。
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/mcenahle/"
              target="_blank"
              class="btn btn-primary"
              >查看我的 GitHub <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          <div class="card-header">学术成果</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p>
              从 2026 年的国庆开始，我似乎开始了自己的 academic
              之旅，尽管这所大专院校什么都没有，甚至 <code>.edu.cn</code> 的电子邮件都没有。
            </p>
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">
                  Leisure Activities and Academic Performance among College
                  Students: A Brief Literature Review
                </h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                  2026-10-02, DOI: <a
                    href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22996542"
                    target="_blank"
                    ><u>10.5281/zenodo.22996542</u>&nbsp;
                    <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
                  >
                </p>
                <a
                  href="/research/leisure-activities-and-academic-performance-among-college-students/"
                  class="btn btn-primary">查看</a
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          <div class="card-header">座右铭</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <figure>
              <blockquote class="blockquote">
                <p>
                  <i
                    >The ending isn't any more important than any of the moments
                    leading to it.</i
                  >
                </p>
              </blockquote>
              <figcaption class="blockquote-footer">
                伊娃·罗莎莉恩（Dr. Eva Rosalene），《To the Moon》
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .blockquote-footer {
    text-align: end;
  }

  .table > :not(caption) > * > * {
    padding: 2px;
  }
</style>

<div
  class="modal fade"
  id="exampleModal"
  tabindex="-1"
  aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="exampleModalLabel">
          <Icon name="mdi:github" /> 即将跳转 GitHub 网站...
        </h1>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="btn-close"
          data-bs-dismiss="modal"
          aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>
          即将跳转 GitHub 网站（URL：<u>https://github.com/mcenahle</u
          >）。是否继续？
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/mcenahle"
          target="_blank"
          type="button"
          class="btn btn-primary">继续 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
        >
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal"
          >关闭</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
